# steel

A reference of steel data: grade, constants and hot-rolled IPE sections,
revision A. Its packed copy, `steel-revA.texlz`, is a reference of the
beam package (`../beam/references/`), imported there as
`~/references/steel-revA.texlz`, which reads its `index.texl`.

